      "id": "standard-way",
      "title": "The standard way",
      "body": "Use Không sao đâu as your first sentence for \"It's okay\". Say this when someone apologizes and you want to reassure them. Leave a short pause after the phrase so the other person can answer with a short reply, a smile, a time, or a light follow-up question. Keep your voice calm and let the short phrase do the politeness work before you add another request.",
