      "id": "why-it-matters",
      "title": "Why it matters",
      "body": "Polite Vietnamese often works by softening the start or end of an interaction before the main request. For \"It's okay\", Không sao đâu helps by using a short friendly phrase that invites a clear reply. Pause naturally after the phrase; these exchanges work best when the reply has room to arrive.",
      "presentation": "plain-text"
